# Leaflet Power BI visual

- Target Leaflet 1.9.4. Use documented factories (`L.map`, `L.tileLayer.wms`, `L.geoJSON`, `L.circleMarker`).
- Keep the map instance; `invalidateSize` on resize; `map.remove()` only in `destroy()`.
- Popup/tooltip strings from data must use DOM `textContent`, never raw HTML.
- Pair every `settings.ts` slice name with a `capabilities.json` property.
- Format pane must persist with no data: `supportsEmptyDataView`, `selector: null`, `forceNullSelectors`, `applyFormattingObjects`.
- Remote tiles, WMS, GeoJSON, and shapefiles require `WebAccess` (localhost is not covered by `http://*`).
- Shapefile is a Format pane URL. Convert with `shpjs`, then `L.geoJSON`.
- Work in `MetroMap/`; run `pbiviz` from that folder. No Format-pane file picker.
